msgid "Using the Redis Client"
msgstr "使用Redis客户端"

msgid "This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can connect to a Redis server using the Redis Client extension."
msgstr "本指南演示了如何将你的Quarkus应用通过Redis客户端扩展连接到Redis服务器。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid "Being _stable_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem are taken very seriously."
msgstr ""

msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

